  "bio.long.1": "Cannix is a Belgian DJ & producer who has been active in the music world for over 5 years. As a DJ he moves between different styles and settings, from all-round parties with recognisable singalongs and party records to hard remixes and energetic Drum & Bass.",
  "bio.long.2": "Within Drum & Bass his focus includes Jump Up. Hardstyle and Jumpstyle are also part of his musical style. This broad interest lets Cannix adapt to different audiences and events without losing sight of the energy.",
  "bio.long.3": "Besides DJing, Cannix is also active as a producer. In the studio he works on his own sound and continually experiments with new music, sounds and ideas.",
  "bio.long.4": "Whether behind the decks or in the studio, the goal remains the same: make people move, hold their attention and create an atmosphere that stays with them.",
  "bio.short": "Cannix is a DJ & producer with over 5 years of experience. He moves between all-round party music, singalongs, hard remixes and Drum & Bass, with Jump Up, Hardstyle and Jumpstyle also part of his sound.\n\nWhatever he plays or produces, the goal is simple: make people move, hold their attention and create energy.",
  "video.1.title": "Mexican Wave Party 2026 - Highlights", "video.1.description": "An energetic set during Mexican Wave Party 2026 with the crowd in the pit.", "video.2.title": "Silent Disco 2025 - Full Set", "video.2.description": "A unique silent disco experience where everyone dances to their own frequency.", "video.3.title": "PEMP 2024 - DJ Cannix Live", "video.3.description": "Live recording from the 2024 PEMP festival.", "video.4.title": "Blacklight Party 2024", "video.4.description": "Neon vibes and blacklight energy with DJ Cannix.", "video.5.title": "Mexican Wave Party 2024", "video.5.description": "One of the biggest Mexican Wave editions ever.", "video.6.title": "'t Leerke 2025 - Aftermovie", "video.6.description": "Aftermovie of an unforgettable night at 't Leerke.",
  "terms.s1": "1. Scope|These terms apply to all quotes, agreements and bookings with Cannix (the Artist). Confirming a booking means the client accepts these terms in full.",
  "terms.s2": "2. Booking & Confirmation|A booking is final only after written confirmation by the Artist and receipt of any requested deposit. Verbal agreements are not binding without written confirmation.",
  "terms.s3": "3. Fee & Payment|The fee is set out in the quote or agreement. A 25% deposit is due on confirmation; the balance is due no later than 7 days before the performance unless agreed otherwise. Amounts exclude VAT unless stated otherwise.",
  "terms.s4": "4. Cancellation by Client|For cancellation more than 30 days before the date: 25% of the fee. Between 14 and 30 days: 50%. Less than 14 days: 100% is due. Cancellations must be communicated in writing.",
  "terms.s5": "5. Cancellation by Artist|The Artist may cancel due to force majeure (illness, family circumstances or government order). In that case the full deposit is refunded and the Artist will try to recommend a replacement.",
  "terms.s6": "6. Technical Rider|The Client provides the technical requirements in the rider (sound system, lighting and performance space). If unavailable, the Artist may adjust the fee or refuse the performance without refund.",
  "terms.s7": "7. Copyright & Recordings|Audio or video recordings for commercial use require written permission from the Artist. Social-media imagery for the event's promotion is permitted.",
  "terms.s8": "8. Liability|The Artist is not liable for damage caused by force majeure, technical failures outside their control or third parties. Liability is limited to the agreed fee.",
  "terms.s9": "9. Governing Law|Belgian law applies to all agreements with Cannix. Disputes are submitted to the competent courts of the Artist's registered location.",
  "privacy.s1": "1. Who are we?|Cannix is a musical business operating as a DJ and entertainer in Belgium. We process personal data for booking requests and communication.",
  "privacy.s2": "2. What data do we collect?|Our contact form collects name, email, phone number, event type, date, location and message content. This data is used only to handle your booking.",
  "privacy.s3": "3. Purpose of processing|Your data is processed to answer booking requests, prepare quotes and send contracts and invoices. We never use it for commercial email campaigns without your explicit consent.",
  "privacy.s4": "4. How long do we keep your data?|We keep personal data no longer than necessary. Contact-form data is kept for up to 2 years; booking and invoicing data for 7 years as required by Belgian accounting law.",
  "privacy.s5": "5. Sharing with third parties|We do not share your data unless necessary to perform the agreement or legally required. We do not use tracking cookies or advertising networks.",
  "privacy.s6": "6. Your rights|You have the right to access, rectify, erase and transfer your personal data, and to object to processing. Contact bookings@cannix.be.",
